# Knowledge CI 上下文注入规则 / Knowledge CI context injection

修改关键模块文件前，请先运行注入命令，将输出作为上下文参考。
Before editing a key module file, run the injection command and use its output as context:

```powershell
python <PATH-TO-KNOWLEDGE-CI>/scripts/inject_context.py --file <当前文件 / current file>
```

输出包含：知识摘要、风险等级、历史决策、影响警告、最近验证时间。
The output includes: knowledge summary, risk level, historical decisions,
impact warnings, and the last verified date.

> 安装方式：把本文件复制到目标项目的 `.cursor/rules/` 目录，按项目实际路径
> 修改 globs 与命令路径后重启 Cursor。
> Install: copy this file into `.cursor/rules/` of your project, adjust the
> globs and command path, then restart Cursor.
